 {!hasCurrentStatus&&<Notice tone="warning" title="Historical snapshot">{presentation.health.service==='unknown'?'Current service health is unknown.':'Current time estimates are unavailable; the service failure was confirmed separately.'} Last status update: {presentation.evidence.snapshotAge}.</Notice>}
